====Noun====
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|often preceded by ''the''}} The [[environment]] outside of [[enclosed]] [[structure]]s.
#: {{ant|en|indoors}}
#: {{ux|en|He won't leave his house: he's afraid of the '''outdoors'''.}}
# {{lb|en|often preceded by ''the''}} The [[natural]] environment in the open air, [[countryside]] away from cities and buildings.
#: {{syn|en|great outdoors|God's country}}
#: {{ux|en|She loves the '''outdoors''', for its freedom and fresh air.}}

